## Monolith vs Microservices

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Monolith\nSingle repo, single server\nAll-in-one] -- evolves --> B[Three-Tier\nFrontend + Backend + DB\nseparated]
    B -- scales --> C[Microservices\nMany independent\nservices]
```

| Approach | Description |
|---|---|
| **Monolith** | All functionality — routing, DB, frontend — in one project, repo, and server |
| **Microservices** | App split into independently deployable services, each with a focused responsibility |
| **The Reality** | It's a **spectrum** — pick the right balance for your project size and complexity |

